{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31104","headline":"题大云寺西阁 · 薛能","name":"题大云寺西阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阁临偏险寺当山，独坐西城笑满颜。\n四野有歌行路乐，五营无战射堂闲。\n鼙和调角秋空外，砧办征衣落照间。\n方拟杀身酬圣主，敢於高处恋乡关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}